      "source": "Create a comparison object according to the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.Order.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.Order</code></a>.",
