      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Value is not <code>null</code>: Compare according to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.Order.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.Order</code></a>. Also, when ordering with <code>NULLS LAST</code>,\nallow <code>NULL</code> values in the predicate",
      "translation": "Value 不为 <code>null</code>：根据 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.Order.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.Order</code></a> 进行比较。此外，在使用 <code>NULLS LAST</code> 进行排序时，允许谓词中包含 <code>NULL</code> 值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Value is <code>null</code> and null values are not the maximum value: restrict to <code>IS NOT NULL</code>",
